{88}{Your paltry skill would be no challenge for me, I would skewer you as easily as a fish on a platter.  Leave me, and do not bother me again unless you achieve a level worthy of my notice.}{Your paltry skill would be no challenge for me, I would skewer you as easily as a fish on a platter.  Leave me, and do not bother me again unless you achieve a level worthy of my notice.}{}{}{}{}
