{101}{It is in regards to my betrothed, the Lady Druella.  She is a petite beauty, fragile as women of breeding are...I was forced into a duel, which she had the misfortune to witness.  I destroyed the offender and I fear the sight of such violence was just too much for her delicate sensibilities.}{It is in regards to my betrothed, the Lady Druella.  She is a petite beauty, fragile as women of breeding are...I was forced into a duel, which she had the misfortune to witness.  I destroyed the offender and I fear the sight of such violence was just too much for her delicate sensibilities.}{}{}{}{}
{102}{What happened?}{}{5}{}{106}{}
{103}{My apologies, but I must be on my way.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{104}{Wha' happen?}{}{-4}{}{106}{}
{105}{E:}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{106}{She fled the scene, obviously distraught. I tracked her to try and calm her, but when I discovered her location, it was too late.  She had been surrounded by a pack of Gyr-Dolour.  I dared not show myself, for fear of increasing her distress and provoking the beasts.}{She fled the scene, obviously distraught. I tracked her to try and calm her, but when I discovered her location, it was too late.  She had been surrounded by a pack of Gyr-Dolour.  I dared not show myself, for fear of increasing her distress and provoking the beasts.}{}{}{}{}
{107}{Gyr-Dolour?  What are they?}{}{5}{}{113}{}
{108}{My apologies, but I must be on my way.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{109}{Why have you not rescued her from the creatures?}{}{5}{}{118}{}
{110}{Geer Doler?  Wha' dat?}{}{-4}{}{113}{}
{111}{Why you no go get her?}{}{-4}{}{118}{}
{112}{E:}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{113}{Foul beasts, and very deadly!  They seek out the weak and the traumatized and feed on their strong emotions. Their vicitms exist in a trancelike state of emotional agony...sometimes for months before they die.  The Gyr-Dolours, usually a pack of them, provide basic needs for their prey, so that they may prolong their feeding.}{Foul beasts, and very deadly!  They seek out the weak and the traumatized and feed on their strong emotions. Their vicitms exist in a trancelike state of emotional agony...sometimes for months before they die.  The Gyr-Dolours, usually a pack of them, provide basic needs for their prey, so that they may prolong their feeding.}{}{}{}{}
{114}{Why have you not rescued her from the creatures?}{}{5}{}{118}{}
{116}{Why you no go get her?}{}{-4}{}{118}{}
{118}{I fear that my presence would further agonize the Lady Druella,  perhaps sending her further into the traumatized realms of her haunted mind.  If this happens, the Gyr-Dolour would most certainly go into a frenzy.  I fear they might do her harm in this state.}{I fear that my presence would further agonize the Lady Druella,  perhaps sending her further into the traumatized realms of her haunted mind.  If this happens, the Gyr-Dolour would most certainly go into a frenzy.  I fear they might do her harm in this state.}{}{}{}{}
{119}{I see.  What is it you want me to do?}{}{5}{}{130}{}
{120}{Won't she eventually come to her senses and return?}{}{5}{}{125}{}
{122}{Me 'nderstand.  Wha' you want me do?}{}{-4}{}{130}{}
{123}{Will she no get better, den come back when she happy?}{}{-4}{}{125}{}
{125}{If the victim should ever come become strong and attempt to leave, the Gyr-Dolours kill them and go in search of new prey.}{If the victim should ever come become strong and attempt to leave, the Gyr-Dolours kill them and go in search of new prey.}{}{}{}{}
{126}{I see.  What is it you want me to do?}{}{5}{}{130}{}
{127}{My apologies, but I must be on my way.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{128}{Me 'nderstand.  Wha' you want me do?}{}{-4}{}{130}{}
