{135}{Then I need you to speak to Lady Druella.  Tell her of my desire to wed her.  Let her know that I am sorry she was distressed over witnessing the carnage,  tell her I have a proposal for her...}{Then I need you to speak to Lady Druella.  Tell her of my desire to wed her.  Let her know that I am sorry she was distressed over witnessing the carnage,  tell her I have a proposal for her...}{}{}{}{}
{136}{A proposal?}{}{5}{}{140}{}
{138}{A proypoysal? What dat?}{}{-4}{}{140}{}
{140}{During the battle, my opponent, Adkin Chambers, was badly disfigured and blinded.  He now resides outside of Stillwater, a crazed recluse.  The Lady Druella knew him, and is distraught over the circumstance. Tell her I have found a way to cure his blindness.}{During the battle, my opponent, Adkin Chambers, was badly disfigured and blinded.  He now resides outside of Stillwater, a crazed recluse.  The Lady Druella knew him, and is distraught over the circumstance. Tell her I have found a way to cure his blindness.}{}{}{}{}
