{147}{Yes. I have acquired a magickal potion, that once ingested will restore the sight of the blind.  As you can imagine, it was not easy to come by.  To appease her sensibilities, I am offering to gift Adkin with the potion.  If she agrees, that is.}{Yes. I have acquired a magickal potion, that once ingested will restore the sight of the blind.  As you can imagine, it was not easy to come by.  To appease her sensibilities, I am offering to gift Adkin with the potion.  If she agrees, that is.}{}{}{}{}
{148}{What do you mean, if she agrees?}{}{5}{}{152}{}
{150}{What you mean, if she agree?}{}{-4}{}{152}{}
{152}{All I ask is her willing hand in marriage.  She need only return to me in an agreeable state, and I will make sure that Adkin is healed to his former self.  What say you?  Do you accept my task?}{All I ask is her willing hand in marriage.  She need only return to me in an agreeable state, and I will make sure that Adkin is healed to his former self.  What say you?  Do you accept my task?}{}{}{}{qu1114 1}
